{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/db8b6c89194518cceafb086969711372.poster.avif?t=1767944456\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/db8b6c89194518cceafb086969711372.webm?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/db8b6c89194518cceafb086969711372.mp4?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plunge into the Hyper-Dungeon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure awaits! Descend into a glorious pixel-art labyrinth where classic dungeon crawling clashes with electrifying turn-based combat featuring real-time elements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your quest is shaped by your choices, and every character you meet, weapon you wield, or puzzle you solve will change how your adventure plays out. You\u2019ll never experience the same trip twice in the Hyper-Dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The quest to claim the legendary Scared Groowl will not be an easy feat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Ever-shifting Labyrinth!</strong><br> <br><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/9ab3ea3d19a57ee04bf1427108239b21.poster.avif?t=1767944456\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/9ab3ea3d19a57ee04bf1427108239b21.webm?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/9ab3ea3d19a57ee04bf1427108239b21.mp4?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same! The Hyper-Dungeon is a living, breathing challenge that reinvents itself every time you dare to enter. <strong>Navigate 50 meticulously designed level</strong> archetypes across varied biomes, each presenting the chance to battle unique enemy types, overcome lethal traps, and solve mind-bending puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master a turn-based combat system with a real\u2011time twist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/e4eb467ed832b12c0d36b8f682943520.poster.avif?t=1767944456\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/e4eb467ed832b12c0d36b8f682943520.webm?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/e4eb467ed832b12c0d36b8f682943520.mp4?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the Hyper<strong>\u2011</strong>Dungeon\u2019s fantastical foes in a <strong>fast-paced combat system</strong> that fuses <strong>turn-based decision making</strong> with <strong>real-time action elements</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need lightning<strong>\u2011</strong>fast reflexes to maximise damage dealt, critical hits, and even perfect parries with the arcade\u2011inspired <i>Swing Meter. </i>Harness the power of a vast arsenal of powerful weapons, each of which alters your abilities and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge your Legend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/c32c4505bee9675b1ae4756267777bfd.poster.avif?t=1767944456\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/c32c4505bee9675b1ae4756267777bfd.webm?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/c32c4505bee9675b1ae4756267777bfd.mp4?t=1767944456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between three distinct profiles</strong>: the <strong>combat\u2011focused Destroyer</strong>, the <strong>stealthy Explorer</strong>, or the <strong>lore\u2011hungry Resolver</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolster your abilities with the intuitive crafting system, experiment with skill trees unique to each weapon, and take advantage of a deep character customisation system and build a dungeoneer worthy of the legends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Laugh and Loot!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/0a8dfcb9252835b361613e74cc9c21d9.avif?t=1767944456\" width=1273 height=696 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crazy<strong>\u2011</strong>Hyper Dungeon Chronicles is a serious challenge, but it\u2019s also packed with sharp dialogue, exceedingly eccentric individuals, and a LOT of pop culture and video game references that will hopefully make you smile as you fight for your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/extras/ae6adb73d5ed2001171db690421e332b.avif?t=1767944456\" width=1424 height=1732 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Alone in the Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/8713c65bd0f5da38656b7162afcca4248f9d9337.jpg"},{"name":"Delightful Person!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/93b69ff7c67aaa1ba328f28c18b6af71724f42a0.jpg"},{"name":"Junk Dealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/5618a938e07c7459417ee05538892929b5d3f48b.jpg"},{"name":"Germaphobe!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/e35996c6dae09691925de71e015473bb561dafea.jpg"},{"name":"Mortality!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/ac3778fc4a3930b0b8dbab5e10361e96ba493963.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/e6d1759b63477f6700a44464a6d77ebd17c361cd.jpg"},{"name":"Punch Express!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/25bf4892216462097d5146c45e3bf85237be04b4.jpg"},{"name":"Like a thief!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/958e2960c0d09496644059bd2371920ea72df856.jpg"},{"name":"Dark So... is nothing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/d71c40526ca9d7d14b8cc57b94a5b38ede4c877f.jpg"},{"name":"2-Thor's Pride!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510490/5b5782eb056ce9ae23a26bffd0bffa1cf8fe5d9d.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510490?t=1767944456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510490/98afaa5d528df74a2379b385170b